  Result: Fixed the bug where usage of retried-away model calls was not included in the accumulated usage. The patch updates usage metrics before the retry check in the event loop, ensuring all calls contribute to usage totals.

The existing tests for multiagent swarm are failing due to missing AWS credentials causing model call failures, unrelated to this fix.

You can verify the fix with the minimal reproducer script provided in the issue description, which does not depend on external credentials.

